    "updated_at": "2017-03-29T05:56:38Z",
    "body": "That would also end up affecting service workers. Probably does not make sense there, @wanderview @jungkees?\r\n\r\nThe other thing is that we recently added WorkerOptions as second argument for dedicated workers and third argument for shared workers. If we added name as member there for dedicated workers that would make the APIs somewhat asymmetric. WorkerOptions is perhaps not implemented though (not sure anyone is doing that part of JavaScript modules) so maybe we can still change things around.",
