    "body": "I don't have a strong opinion but this sounds reasonable. @kinu @nhiroki\r\n\r\nShould the API enforce the uniqueness of the name?\r\n\r\nFor service workers, the spec calls for an `id` per service worker which additionally is unique within a scope. However there is talk of removing that from the spec https://github.com/w3c/ServiceWorker/issues/1076\r\n\r\nIt feels like this should be aligned with the service worker spec somehow. @jakearchibald ",
